# Game tests

Apply [agents/guidelines/04-testing.md](../../agents/guidelines/04-testing.md).

- Iterate registries with `it.each(Object.entries(...))` — do not test single entities in isolation.
- Put shape checks in `validateDefinition.js` (or domain equivalent).
- Run `npm run test:run` after changes.

Use skill **game-registry-tests** when adding or refactoring tests.
